model ul11
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "Spanish wealth tax (IP) 2025 capped by income tax (IRPF): art. 31 Ley 19/1991, the 60 per cent limit and the 80 per cent maximum reduction, for Don J.B.A., single and resident in Toledo (AEAT Manual práctico de Patrimonio 2025, Ejemplo)."
  note "Every ask is evaluated at the devengo of the 2025 tax, 31 December 2025."
  note "The example also gives the base liquidable general (48.000) and the mínimo personal y familiar (5.550); the cap doesn't use them, so they are not inputs."
  note "Not modelled, as in the example: regional bonificaciones, the deduction for taxes paid abroad, and the Impuesto Temporal de Solidaridad de las Grandes Fortunas."

source aeat_ejemplo "AEAT, Manual práctico de Patrimonio 2025, Capítulo 5, Límite de cuota íntegra y cuota mínima, Ejemplo (Página actualizada: 17/marzo/2026)" at "https://sede.agenciatributaria.gob.es/Sede/ayuda/manuales-videos-folletos/manuales-practicos/patrimonio-2025/c-5-determinacion-cuota-ingresar/limite-cuota-integra-cuota-minima-patrimonio/ejemplo.html"

source aeat_reglas "AEAT, Manual práctico de Patrimonio 2025, Capítulo 5, Límite de cuota íntegra: Reglas (Página actualizada: 17/marzo/2026)" at "https://sede.agenciatributaria.gob.es/Sede/ayuda/manuales-videos-folletos/manuales-practicos/patrimonio-2025/c-5-determinacion-cuota-ingresar/limite-cuota-integra-cuota-minima-patrimonio/reglas.html"

source ley35_2006 "Ley 35/2006, de 28 de noviembre, del IRPF, disposición final cuarta, apartado Tres: new wording of the whole of art. 31 of Ley 19/1991, de 6 de junio, del Impuesto sobre el Patrimonio (BOE núm. 285, 29/11/2006); the wording is read in the BOE texto consolidado of Ley 19/1991, https://www.boe.es/buscar/act.php?id=BOE-A-1991-14392 ('Última actualización, publicada el 29/11/2006, en vigor a partir del 01/01/2007')" at "https://www.boe.es/buscar/act.php?id=BOE-A-2006-20764"

source modeller "The model's own readings and assumptions, each stated with its reason"

unit EUR: currency minor 0.01

axis ul11_cent
  down "amounts computed to the cent are cut down to the cent"
  half-up "amounts computed to the cent go to the nearest cent, ties up (the example prints 89.883,496 as 89.883,50)"

input bi_ahorro: money EUR

input bi_general: money EUR

input bi_ip: money EUR

input c0424: money EUR question "What is casilla [0424], the net gains in the IRPF savings base?"

input cap_rate: num

input cuota_ahorro: money EUR

input cuota_general: money EUR

input cuota_ip: money EUR

input epn: money EUR
  note "Net value of the assets that by their nature or use can't produce income taxed by the IRPF (art. 31.Uno b))."

input gains_gt1: money EUR
  note "Positive balance of gains on assets held more than one year, inside the savings base (art. 31.Uno a))."

input max_red: num

input min_share: num

input offsets: money EUR question "What are the loss and negative-yield offsets in casillas [0436], [0439]-[0445] and [0447]?"

def cuota_improd: money EUR at reader
  note "Solución line 1; Regla 3ª: CIBI = EPN × cuota íntegra ÷ base imponible (art. 31.Uno b))."
  rule base v reglas2025 = round(epn * cuota_ip / bi_ip, minor(EUR), ul11_cent)

def cuota_ingresar: num EUR at reader
  note "Solución last line: the cuota íntegra less the reduction."
  rule base v law_ip31 = cuota_ip - reduction

def cuota_min: money EUR at reader
  note "Nota (3); Regla 3ª: the cuota mínima no reducible, 20 per cent of the cuota íntegra."
  rule base v reglas2025 = round(min_share * cuota_ip, minor(EUR), ul11_cent)

def cuota_susc: money EUR at reader
  note "Solución line 2: the IP cuota subject to the limit."
  rule base v law_ip31 = cuota_ip - cuota_improd

def excess: num EUR at reader
  note "Nota (3): the exceso no reducible, the theoretical reduction above the maximum."
  rule base = max(0, red_theory - red_max)

def excl_base: num EUR at reader
  note "Regla 1ª: the part of the savings base left out, (gains over one year ÷ [0424]) × ([0424] − offsets), when the balance is below [0424]."
  rule base v reglas2025 = gains_gt1 / c0424 * (c0424 - offsets)
  rule notbelow beats base = ?"Regla 1ª as given covers a balance of gains over one year below casilla [0424]; the other case is not in the sources." when gains_gt1 >= c0424

def irpf_sum: num EUR at reader
  note "Solución line 5: the IRPF cuotas counted for the limit."
  rule base v law_ip31 = cuota_general + kept_cuota_ahorro

def kept_base: num EUR at reader
  note "Solución, 'Base imponible del ahorro IRPF: 1.000 (2)': the savings base counted for the limit (art. 31.Uno a))."
  rule base v law_ip31 = bi_ahorro - excl_base

def kept_cuota_ahorro: num EUR at reader
  note "Solución line 4 and Nota (1); Regla 2ª: (cuotas del ahorro ÷ base imponible del ahorro) × the savings base counted."
  rule base v reglas2025 = cuota_ahorro / bi_ahorro * kept_base

def limit60: num EUR at reader
  note "Solución line 7: 60 per cent of the IRPF bases counted (art. 31.Uno)."
  rule base v law_ip31 = cap_rate * (bi_general + kept_base)

def red_max: money EUR at reader
  note "Solución line 9: the reduction may not exceed 80 per cent of the IP cuota (art. 31.Uno c))."
  rule base v law_ip31 = round(max_red * cuota_ip, minor(EUR), ul11_cent)

def red_theory: num EUR at reader
  note "Solución line 8: the reduction that would bring the cuotas down to the limit."
  rule base v law_ip31 = max(0, total_cuotas - limit60)

def reduction: num EUR at reader
  note "Art. 31.Uno c): reduced to the limit, by no more than the maximum."
  rule base v law_ip31 = min(red_theory, red_max)

def total_cuotas: num EUR at reader
  note "Solución line 6: IRPF cuotas plus the IP cuota subject to the limit."
  rule base v law_ip31 = irpf_sum + cuota_susc

ask q01_improd: cuota_improd law 2025-12-31

ask q02_susc: cuota_susc law 2025-12-31

ask q03_ahorro: kept_cuota_ahorro law 2025-12-31

ask q04_irpf_sum: irpf_sum law 2025-12-31

ask q05_total: total_cuotas law 2025-12-31

ask q06_kept_base: kept_base law 2025-12-31

ask q07_limit: limit60 law 2025-12-31

ask q08_red_theory: red_theory law 2025-12-31

ask q09_red_max: red_max law 2025-12-31

ask q10_ingresar: cuota_ingresar law 2025-12-31

ask q11_min: cuota_min law 2025-12-31

ask q12_excess: excess law 2025-12-31

ask q13_coincide: check cuota_ingresar == cuota_min law 2025-12-31

version law_ip31
  cite ley35_2006
  governs 2007..
  known 2006-11-29
  note "Known from the publication of Ley 35/2006 in the BOE, 29/11/2006 (BOE núm. 285; https://www.boe.es/buscar/act.php?id=BOE-A-2006-20764), whose disposición final cuarta, Tres gave art. 31 the wording in force from 01/01/2007. The BOE consolidated text of Ley 19/1991 is the locator, not the version."
  note "Art. 31.Dos (joint IRPF filing, prorated reduction) doesn't apply: the taxpayer is single."
  cap_rate = 0.6 "art. 31.Uno 'del 60 por 100 de la suma de las bases imponibles' (texto consolidado BOE-A-1991-14392)"
  max_red = 0.8 "art. 31.Uno c) 'sin que la reducción pueda exceder del 80 por 100' (texto consolidado BOE-A-1991-14392)"

version reglas2025
  cite aeat_reglas
  governs 2025
  known 2026-03-17
  note "The Reglas page carries no date of its own: known from its updated stamp, 'Página actualizada: 17/marzo/2026' (§4.5)."
  note "Regla 1ª: the excluded part of the savings base; Regla 2ª: 'Casilla [35] = (Cuotas ... [0540] + [0541] ÷ base imponible del ahorro Casilla [0460]) x Casilla [32]'; Regla 3ª: 'CIBI = EPN x Cuota íntegra ÷ Base Imponible'."
  min_share = 0.2 "Regla 3ª 'una cuota mínima no reducible ... equivalente al 20 por 100 de la cuota íntegra'"

version facts_ejemplo
  cite aeat_ejemplo
  governs always
  known 2026-10-18
  note "The example's stipulations are a hypothetical case: known from the model's on (§4.5), not from the page's updated stamp (17/marzo/2026)."
  note "Ejercicio 2025. The 2024 edition of the Manual prints the same example with the same figures."
  bi_ahorro = 2000 "Ejemplo: 'Base imponible y liquidable del ahorro del IRPF: 2.000'"
  bi_general = 50000 "Ejemplo: 'Base imponible general del IRPF: 50.000'"
  bi_ip = 8000000 "Ejemplo: 'Base imponible del Impuesto sobre el Patrimonio: 8.000.000'"
  cuota_ahorro = 380 "Ejemplo: 'Cuota íntegra del ahorro del IRPF: 380'"
  cuota_general = 12407 "Ejemplo: 'Cuota íntegra general estatal y autonómica del IRPF: 12.407'"
  cuota_ip = 112354.37 "Ejemplo: 'Cuota íntegra del Impuesto sobre el Patrimonio: 112.354,37'"
  epn = 250000 "Ejemplo: the net value of the assets not capable of producing IRPF income 'asciende a 250.000 euros'"
  gains_gt1 = 1000 "Ejemplo: the part of the savings base from gains on assets held more than one year 'asciende a 1.000 euros'"

version model_assume
  cite modeller
  governs always
  known 2026-10-18
  note "Assumptions standing for the example's own facts: known from the model's on, as the example (§4.5)."
  c0424 = 2000 assumed "the example applies Regla 1ª with 2.000, the whole savings base, in place of casilla [0424], as if the savings base were all gains"
  offsets = 0 assumed "the example subtracts no loss or negative-yield offsets ([0436], [0439]-[0445], [0447])"
